Параметр & Значение \\
$f_{\text{н}}$ & \VAR{ b4b5_signal_params[encoding_type].freq.low | round(3) } МГц \\
$f_{\text{в}}$ & \VAR{ b4b5_signal_params[encoding_type].freq.high | round(3) } МГц \\
$S$ & \VAR{ b4b5_signal_params[encoding_type].freq.spectrum | round(3) } МГц \\
$f_{\text{ср}}$ & \VAR{ b4b5_signal_params[encoding_type].freq.avg | round(3) } МГц \\
